              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ngölono ngölyontonï pipö Moap. Kakiwur kanastina Ar nko Kir ompö oghö akonga, kïsï nyu koro Moap lasay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpusta pipö Dipon wölo kïsogho körkeyïntin akïriryö. Kiriryö pipö Moap, kïrirchï kanastina Nepo nko Medepa ompö nyarïl, kirwach mötöwekwa nko tamughayikwa ompö nyarïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulach sarankwachtin pich cho kipestegho ortïna kanastin. Kiriryeghö pich kwenu kanasyan nko paraku korïn wölo le pörkö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riryot tya pipö Espon nko cho pö Eleale ntökelïma Yaas. Köriryö pipö lïk cho pö Moap akiwonyeghö nyakanat chane lökïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rirchini mïkulöwunyan Moap! Kepertoy pikachi kutang kanasyanta Soar nko Eklat Syelisyiya. Kïpusta walaka kïrïp or nyo wetöy Luit, akïmi kïrirsot otini petöy, kupertoy walaka kutang Oronaim nko nyarïl nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kiteny pögho Nimrim, akïsilonchö suswö cho kimi kamasunyi, amelö kitökïngötï kïgh nyo nyaril nyonikïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona nyu, kurit tïkukwa cho chang cho kinyorï nko cho kökikïror, akïpa kwoghyö champilwa nyo mi ketï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichögh rirata söremwok löwïr cho pö koro Moap. Kikïlïma raranoni kanastina Eklaim nko Peerelim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipïröchitu pögho kanasyanta Dipon ompö kisön, amelö choni opïn, kitïng Tororöt kïgh nyo gha tya ompö pïchoni, ompöwölo itu pörchö nyo kïpöröy chi anka tïkwïl nyo ngötuno koro Moap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Melö tïng pipö Moap kikönöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
